    <if expr="lang == 'fr' or lang == 'fr-CA'">
      <message name="IDS_ENABLE_DEBUGGING_SETUP_MESSAGE" desc="Setup message in dialog for enabling debugging features.">
      Vous activez les fonctionnalitÃ©s de dÃ©bogage openWings8 qui configureront le dÃ©mon sshd et activeront le dÃ©marrage depuis les clÃ©s USB.
      </message>
      <message name="IDS_WRONG_HWID_SCREEN_MESSAGE_FIRST_PART" desc="Warning message shown on screen notifying about malformed hardware ID. First paragraph.">
        Malheureusement, votre ordinateur est configurÃ© avec un identifiant matÃ©riel malformÃ©. Cela empÃªche openWings8 de se mettre Ã  jour avec les derniers correctifs de sÃ©curitÃ© et votre ordinateur <ph name="BEGIN_BOLD">$1</ph>peut Ãªtre vulnÃ©rable aux attaques malveillantes<ph name="END_BOLD">$2</ph>.
      </message>
      <message name="IDS_FILEMANAGER_APP_DESCRIPTION" desc="Description for the File Manager app.">
        L'application Fichiers offre un accÃ¨s rapide aux fichiers enregistrÃ©s sur Google Drive, un stockage externe ou votre appareil openWings8.
      </message>
    </if>
    <if expr="lang != 'fr' and lang != 'fr-CA'">
      <message name="IDS_ENABLE_DEBUGGING_SETUP_MESSAGE" desc="Setup message in dialog for enabling debugging features.">
      You are enabling openWings8 debugging features which will set up sshd daemon and enable booting from USB drives.
      </message>
      <message name="IDS_WRONG_HWID_SCREEN_MESSAGE_FIRST_PART" desc="Warning message shown on screen notifying about malformed hardware ID. First paragraph.">
        Unfortunately, your computer is configured with a malformed hardware ID. This prevents openWings8 from updating with the latest security fixes and your computer <ph name="BEGIN_BOLD">$1</ph>may be vulnerable to malicious attacks<ph name="END_BOLD">$2</ph>.
